Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.98,0:22:33.26,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}tsutaete! anata no kokoro no oku wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.65,0:22:40.64,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}kanjite! setsunai mune no kodou wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.96,0:22:44.52,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\c&H90CFD3&}biru no mukou no boyaketa keshiki
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.69,0:22:48.44,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\c&HC6C0A1&}kizukeba mata anata wo omotte
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.54,0:22:54.63,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\c&HF6DCF8&}aenai hi ni wa tameiki bakari tsuite sugoshiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.37,0:23:02.65,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\c&HDFEFE6&}kuchibiru ga anata dake ni irozuku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.90,0:23:09.16,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,1200)\c&HD3AD75&}ano hi shita kisu no yoin ga kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.61,0:23:17.67,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\c&HB1DCFA&}mada ima wa hitori no yoru ga tsurai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.05,0:23:26.19,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,200)\c&H887E95&}futari no kizuna ga motto tsuyoku naru made
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.98,0:22:33.26,ED2 Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}伝えて!　あなたの心の奥を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.65,0:22:40.64,ED2 Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}感じて!　切ない胸の鼓動を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.96,0:22:44.52,ED2 Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\c&H90CFD3&}ビルの向こうのぼやけた景色
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.69,0:22:48.44,ED2 Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\c&HC6C0A1&}気付けばまたあなたを思って
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.54,0:22:54.63,ED2 Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\c&HF6DCF8&}会えない日にはため息ばかりついて過ごしてる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.37,0:23:02.65,ED2 Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\c&HDFEFE6&}唇があなただけに色付く
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.90,0:23:09.16,ED2 Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,1200)\c&HD3AD75&}あの日したキスの余韻が消えない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.61,0:23:17.67,ED2 Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\c&HB1DCFA&} まだ今は一人の夜が辛い
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.05,0:23:26.19,ED2 Kanji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,200)\c&H887E95&}二人の絆がもっと強くなるまで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.98,0:22:33.26,ED2 Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Deixe os sentimentos do fundo de seu coração despertarem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.65,0:22:40.64,ED2 Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Sinta em seu peito o bater solitário do seu coração.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.96,0:22:44.52,ED2 Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\c&H90CFD3&}Ao olhar além dos prédios, a paisagem noturna,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.69,0:22:48.44,ED2 Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\c&HC6C0A1&}eu me pego pensando em você.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.54,0:22:54.63,ED2 Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\c&HF6DCF8&}Mesmo quando não te vejo, fico sempre pensando em você.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.37,0:23:02.65,ED2 Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\c&HDFEFE6&}Meus lábios pertencem a você.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.90,0:23:09.16,ED2 Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,1200)\c&HD3AD75&}O sabor do beijo daquele dia não desapareceu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.61,0:23:17.67,ED2 Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\c&HB1DCFA&}Ainda sofro com as noites sozinha.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.05,0:23:26.19,ED2 Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,200)\c&H887E95&}Até que os nossos laços fiquem mais forte.
